{"id":5481,"date":"2020-04-07T02:49:33","date_gmt":"2020-04-07T02:49:33","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/jammindjs.net\/?p=5481"},"modified":"2020-04-07T02:49:33","modified_gmt":"2020-04-07T02:49:33","slug":"atlanta-dragoncon-event-djs","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/blog\/atlanta-dragoncon-event-djs\/","title":{"rendered":"Atlanta DragonCon Event DJ&#8217;s"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Atlanta, GA<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s Georgia had the privilege of kicking off a five-day extravaganza as the entertainment hosts of <\/span><strong>Dragon Con<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. The world\u2019s largest annual convention <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/scontent.fapa1-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t1.0-9\/73472665_10157759391548874_3459092838300516352_n.jpg?_nc_cat=106&amp;_nc_sid=0be424&amp;_nc_oc=AQnYbpYstEKITZzedlBGxwNHmZswkF0kp8nn57OHLlw-zj6OTwPApXbrVmkH66ISEVtRfrjSCNOfzUrgxhEWwTts&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fapa1-1.fna&amp;oh=7cf5ff4739629bb2f6aa92d61fde6c67&amp;oe=5EB23436\" alt=\"Image may contain: one or more people and night\" width=\"443\" height=\"249\">of its kind, <\/span>Dragon Con<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> focuses on the massive worlds of science fiction and fantasy. Every media platform imaginable was represented in 2019, including literature, television, and gaming to name a few. Begun August 29, 2019 and held over Labor Day weekend in <strong>Atlanta, GA<\/strong>, Dragon Con hosted more than 85,000 costume clad attendees in total.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dragon Con 2019<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> featured a plethora of events that guests could look forward to attending. Opening ceremonies included a giant costume parade with characters from every possible Sci-Fi universe. Attendees had the opportunity to visit dozens of panels and exhibits featuring their favorite authors, creators and actors. Notable members of Dragon Con\u2019s 2019 class included David Tennant (the 10<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">th<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> iteration of BBC One\u2019s Dr. Who), George Takei of <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Star<\/span><\/i> <i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trek<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and Zachary Levi, star of the DC Comics and Warner Bros. film <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shazam!<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s<\/strong> amazing long weekend included five events in total, and began with a giant bash on opening night at the Hilton Atlanta with DJ Philli B. The excited <strong>convention<\/strong> goers took to the dance floor almost immediately, and it was certainly a sight to see. Where else do you get to watch Captain Kirk dance with Princess Leia, while Iron Man chats up Sailor Moon at the bar? The party spanned the entire massive lobby and even made its way up the stairs to the second level balcony! Hard work clearly went into the beautiful <strong>lighting<\/strong> display, which Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s also provided.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s final event of the weekend was the <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dragon Con<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> after-party at the<strong> Westin Peachtree Plaza<\/strong>, Atlanta on Monday, September 2<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">nd<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. DJ Kevin Reilly was on the 1\u2019s and 2\u2019s, and the costumes were just as exciting and varied as the music selection. I got particular amusement out of watching a giant Pikachu pop and lock to Lil\u2019 Nas X\u2019s summer hit, Old Town Road. The Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s event staff outdid themselves that night, setting up an elaborate laser light show and keeping hundreds dancing throughout the entire event.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dragon Con 2019<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> was an overwhelmingly successful weekend for all of those involved, and Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s was humbled and thrilled to be able to provide entertainment for such a wonderful group of convention goers. Here\u2019s to <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dragon Con 2020<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and hoping that Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s gets the opportunity to rock it once again this year!<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Atlanta, GA Jammin\u2019 DJ\u2019s Georgia had the privilege of kicking off a five-day extravaganza as the entertainment hosts of Dragon Con. The world\u2019s largest annual convention of its kind, Dragon Con focuses on the massive worlds of science fiction and fantasy. Every media platform imaginable was represented in 2019, including literature, television, and gaming to&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5482,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[10,18],"tags":[46,50,55,56,87,107,131,163],"class_list":["post-5481","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog","category-events","tag-atlanta-dj","tag-atlanta-lighting","tag-atlantadjservice","tag-atlantadragoncon","tag-convention-sound","tag-event-dj","tag-lightshow","tag-special-occasion-dj"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Atlanta DragonCon Event DJ&#039;s - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel